
### Create a stock
POST http://localhost:8081/api/stocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "TCS",
  "companyName": "Tata Consultancy Services",
  "exchange": "NSE",
  "sector": "IT"
}


### Get stock by symbol
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stocks/TCS
Accept: application/json



### Get all stocks - first page
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stocks?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json



### Filter by exchange
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stocks?exchange=NSE
Accept: application/json

### Filter by sector
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stocks?sector=IT
Accept: application/json


### Filter by exchange
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stocks?exchange=NSE
Accept: application/json

### Filter by sector
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stocks?sector=IT
Accept: application/json


### Invalid sort field
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stocks?sort=invalidField,asc
Accept: application/json


### Request 100 stocks per page
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stocks?page=0&size=100
Accept: application/json


### Update TCS stock
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/stocks/TCS
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Tata Consultancy Services Limited",
  "exchange": "NSE",
  "sector": "IT Services"
}


### Attempt to create duplicate TCS
POST http://localhost:8081/api/stocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "TCS",
  "companyName": "Duplicate TCS",
  "exchange": "NSE",
  "sector": "IT"
}


### Delete TCS
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/stocks/TCS


### Verify TCS is deleted
GET http://localhost:8081/api/stocks/TCS
Accept: application/json





